// txiki.js worker engine — Zen-C trampolines.
//
// As of G8 (per-worker engine selection), the unified `worker_create`
// / `worker_post_message` / `worker_terminate` dispatchers live in
// `worker.zc` and call the engine-prefixed C symbols
// (`txiki_worker_*`) directly. This file pulls the C header into
// scope so the dispatcher's raw blocks have the symbols available.

@cfg(ZAPP_WORKER_ENGINE_TXIKI)
import "./txiki.h" as txiki_engine;
